   "name": "Julia Montgomery</a> </h2> <p>Dr. Montgomery has a research background in equine immunology and nutrition. Her current research is focused on innate immune mechanisms involved in non-septic lower airway inflammation in horses and remote (secondary) lung injury in horses and dogs. Dr. Montgomery is a member of the Pulmonary Pathobiology Laboratory at Western College of Veterinary Medicine, University of Saskatchewan. For more information please visit http://www.wcvm.com/vmc_clients/respiratory.php</p> <ul class=\"list-inline mb-4\"> <li class=\"list-inline-item mb-3\"><a aria-label=\"Email julia.montgomery@usask.ca\" class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\" href=\"mailto:julia.montgomery@usask.ca\"><i aria-label=\"email icon\" class=\"uofs-icon uofs-icon-email\"></i> julia.montgomery@usask.ca</a></li> <li class=\"list-inline-item mb-3\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\" href=\"tel:3069667025\"><i aria-label=\"phone icon\" class=\"uofs-icon uofs-icon-phone\"></i> 306-966-7025</a></li> <li class=\"list-inline-item mb-3\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\" href=\"https://wcvm.usask.ca/departments/lacs/lacs-people/julia-montgomery.php\">Website</a></li> </ul> <p>Research Area(s): <span class=\"text-muted\">Horse lift system for treatment and rehabilitation</span></p> </div> <hr class=\"mt-3\"/> </div> <div class=\"row py-4\" data-livesearch=\"true\"> <div class=\"col-12 col-md-10\"> <h2 class=\"lh-1\"> <a href=\"https://engineering.usask.ca/people/staff/mooney,glenda.php\">Glenda Mooney",
